{"ref":"BDB, שַׁאֲנָן","hw":"שַׁאֲנָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲנָן</span></big>  <strong>adj. at ease, secure (</strong>Ba<sup>NB § 143 a</sup> Ges<sup>§ 84 b k</sup><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.20\">Is 33:20</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲנַנִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:1\" href=\"/Amos.6.1\">Am 6:1</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲנַנּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.9\">Is 32:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.18\">18</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>at ease, secure:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נָוֶה שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.20\">Is 33:20</a> <em>secure habitation</em> (of Jerus.), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְנוּחוֹת שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.18\">32:18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְטַחִים</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  as subst., <em>one at ease</em>, free from misfortune, <a data-ref=\"Job 12:5\" href=\"/Job.12.5\">Jb 12:5</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>at ease</em>, with collat. idea of <em>careless, wanton, arrogant</em>, <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:1\" href=\"/Amos.6.1\">Am 6:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.9\">Is 32:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:15\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.15\">Zc 1:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 123:4\" href=\"/Psalms.123.4\">ψ 123:4</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  as subst. abstr. = <em>arrogance:</em> sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲנַנְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:28\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.28\">2 K 19:28</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְרַגֶּזְךָ</span>) = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.29\">Is 37:29</a>, but < <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאוֹנְךָ</span> <em>thine uproar</em>, Bu<sup>ZAW xii (1892), 36</sup> Gr Che Marti Kit (perhaps), Bur. cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, שַׁלְאֲנָן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_שַׁלְאֲנָן\